* ''The working address'' (house ruling under the operator's delegation, 2026-10-15; the operator's workbench rulings of 2026-11-11 above flip it). The daemon wiki alone keeps a face-private working document. Every other wiki's working layer rests in a realm workbench at `realmWorkbenchDocUrl(realm, slug)`, `deterministicDocUrl` over the realm board's address with `#working/<slug>`: no member change moves it and knowing it grants nothing, and an unshared wiki's realm id derives from the owning face and the slug (`privateCabalRealmId`), so two offline devices of one face converge on one address (<<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/cabal-realm#/the-workbench`>>).

